hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1448","Al-Hasan bin Muhammad and Salam bin Junada told us, they said: Waki’ told us, Al-Hasan said, he said: Sufyan told us, on the authority of Samak bin Harb, on the authority of Jabir bin Samra said that the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, “would deliver a sermon standing, and sit between the two sermons and recite a verse from the Qur’an. I engaged him intentionally, and his prayer was intentional.” However, Al-Hasan said: He used to recite on the pulpit during his sermon a verse from the Qur’an."
